    "sentence_translations": [
      "",
      "The driver looked at them and said, “Sorry! But right now, I can’t drive. Look!”",
      "",
      "Li Fei and Little Mi saw that all around them … were cars.",
      "",
      "Li Fei shouted out, “How could this happen? Why are there so many cars here?”",
      "",
      "The driver said, “I don’t know! Just when you went to find your watch, lots of cars stopped beside us.”",
      "",
      "“Then, then we aren’t able to go to the movie theater right now?” Little Mi asked.",
      "",
      "“Indeed. Look, with this many cars, we need to wait more than an hour,” the driver said.",
      "",
      "Little Mi didn’t say anything.",
      "",
      "“Sorry, I didn’t know it would turn out like this,” Li Fei said.",
      "",
      "“Don’t worry,” Little Mi smiled and said, “I don’t really like watching movies with my mom.",
      "Where’s your watch? Show me! We have to wait here for more than an hour after all.”"
